            'body_html' => '<p>Lewisville is booming. This city, tucked between Dallas and Fort Worth, is growing fast—and it’s not slowing down anytime soon. According to recent population growth stats, Lewisville has seen a 15% increase in the last decade. New developments are popping up everywhere, and the city’s appeal is obvious: easy access to the Metroplex, a vibrant downtown, and a variety of brand-new apartment communities that are attracting people from all over. But with so many options, how do you choose? Let’s dive into the top new apartments in Lewisville, TX, to help you make the right move.</p>
<h3>1) Solea Lewisville</h3>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Address:</strong> 1450 Valley Ridge Blvd, Lewisville, TX 75077</p>
<p>If you&#8217;re looking for a 55+ active adult community, <a href="https://www.caseusa.com/apartments/tx/lewisville/solea-lewisville/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>Solea Lewisville</em></a> is the place to be. These brand-new apartments combine convenience with luxury, offering resort-style living designed with a more mature crowd in mind. Spacious one and two-bedroom apartments offer modern finishes and top-of-the-line amenities like a resort-style pool, fitness center, and an outdoor kitchen area. You can downsize without sacrificing comfort.</p>
<p>For those seeking a low-maintenance, high-comfort lifestyle, Solea gives you access to everything you need in one place. It’s not just an apartment—it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Not to mention, it’s perfectly located close to local dining and shopping hubs like Music City Mall. You’ll never be far from what you love.</p>
<h3>2) The Mill Old Town</h3>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Address: </strong>535 S Mill St, Lewisville, TX 75057</p>
<p>Old Town charm with a modern twist. That’s what <a href="https://www.milloldtown.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>The Mill Old Town</em></a> offers. This new community brings the energy of historic downtown Lewisville to life with apartments that blend traditional architecture with contemporary finishes. Steps away from local coffee shops, breweries, and quaint stores, this is a dream for those who love being part of a vibrant, walkable neighborhood.</p>
<p>Inside, the apartments are just as impressive. Think quartz countertops, hardwood floors, and large windows letting in natural light. Plus, with a community lounge, fitness center, and pet-friendly policies, it’s clear <em>The Mill Old Town</em> is designed for a balanced, modern lifestyle. Whether you&#8217;re a professional or a couple looking for a place that combines history with convenience, this location hits the sweet spot.</p>
<h3>3) Tapestry at The Realm</h3>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Address: </strong>2901 Lady Bettye Dr, Lewisville, TX 75056</p>
<p><em>Luxury meets comfort</em> at <a href="https://www.apartments.com/tapestry-at-the-realm-lewisville-tx/xcwts8n/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>Tapestry at The Realm</em></a>. This new addition to Lewisville offers top-tier amenities, including a resort-style pool, a high-end fitness center, and a stunning rooftop lounge. Each unit features high ceilings, stainless steel appliances, and spa-like bathrooms. These details give you the sense you’re living in a high-end hotel rather than an apartment.</p>
<p>But it’s not just about the luxury finishes. Location is key here. Tapestry is part of the larger Castle Hills master-planned community, meaning you’re close to everything. Whether it&#8217;s quick access to major highways, proximity to golf courses, or nearby parks, you’re perfectly positioned to enjoy both city life and natural beauty.</p>
