<p>Beyond aesthetics, Main and Mill offers everything from a rooftop pool to a high-tech fitness center and co-working spaces. You’re also surrounded by local favorites like <em>Old Town Wine House</em> and <em>Tierney’s Café</em>, making it easy to step outside and enjoy everything Lewisville has to offer. It&#8217;s perfect for young professionals, artists, or anyone who wants to be part of this revitalized community.</p>
