<p></p>
<p><strong>Address: </strong>2200 E State Hwy 121 Business, Lewisville, TX 75056</p>
<p>If convenience and cutting-edge design are your priorities, <a href="https://www.auraavant.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>Aura Avant</em></a> delivers. This new complex offers a sleek, modern aesthetic combined with premium amenities that cater to a dynamic lifestyle. We’re talking about a pet park, fitness center, and resort-style pool, all within a beautifully designed community.</p>
<p>Each unit in <em>Aura Avant</em> boasts spacious layouts, wood-style flooring, and gourmet kitchens—ideal for anyone who loves to cook or entertain. And let’s not forget the location: quick access to Highway 121 means you’re just a short drive from all that Dallas and Fort Worth have to offer. If you’re a commuter, this could be the ideal spot to enjoy suburban serenity without sacrificing big-city access.</p>
<h3>6) Merit Northern Gateway</h3>
<figure><img src="/media/blog/new-apartments-in-lewisville-tx-1.webp" alt="Screenshot 2024 10 02 154152" width="1133" height="754" loading="lazy"></figure>
<p><strong>Address: </strong>1000 Grandys Ln Lewisville TX</p>
<p>For those seeking something new with a mix of suburban tranquility and easy access to urban amenities, <a href="https://www.apartments.com/merit-northern-gateway-lewisville-tx/10v3f84/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>Merit Northern Gateway</em></a> checks all the boxes. These apartments offer everything from expansive floor plans to granite countertops and energy-efficient appliances. Living here feels like getting a step up in the world.</p>
<p>Merit also stands out for its amenities, which include a fitness center, clubroom, and resort-style pool. Whether you’re lounging by the pool or hosting a weekend barbecue, it’s the kind of place that elevates everyday living.</p>
<h3>7) Whitlow</h3>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Address:</strong> 501 E College St, Lewisville, TX 75057</p>
<p>Another fantastic option in the heart of Lewisville is <a href="https://www.zillow.com/apartments/lewisville-tx-whitlow-Ccj7mV/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>Whitlow</em></a>. This newly developed apartment complex embraces a sleek, modern design while keeping community at its core. You’ll find spacious floor plans, elegant finishes, and a ton of natural light pouring into every room. Whether it’s for a morning coffee on your balcony or a night in watching movies, these apartments offer comfort without compromising on style.</p>
<p>But beyond just the apartments, <em>Whitlow</em> offers incredible community amenities like a fitness center and clubhouse, creating opportunities to socialize or unwind after a long day. It’s perfect for young professionals and small families alike.</p>
<h3>Honorable Mentions: More New Apartments to Consider</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Hebron 121 Station</strong>: If you want to be close to the lake, Hebron 121 is known for its proximity to Lake Lewisville and its resort-style amenities, including a massive pool area.</li>
<li><strong>Enclave at Vista Ridge</strong>: A bit more traditional but still brand new, this complex is ideal for those wanting easy access to Vista Ridge Mall and all the shopping you can handle.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Final Thoughts: Finding Your Next Apartment in Lewisville</h3>
