<p>But the luxury doesn’t stop at the pool. The Gabriel features high-end finishes like quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and spacious floor plans. Residents also enjoy access to a state-of-the-art fitness center, a pet-friendly environment with an on-site dog park, and beautifully landscaped communal areas. If you crave elegance and convenience, The Gabriel is your go-to choice.</p>
